# go.ymotongpoo.com: vanity import paths for Go modules, plus the pbt guide.
# Rules apply in order, the first match wins, and they take precedence over
# static assets. Destinations are clean URLs: a destination that names an
# index.html or .html file is rejected as a loop by the rule validator.
# The go-import page is stored under /goimport, outside the /pbt pattern.
/pbt/guide        /pbt/guide/        301
/pbt/guide/ja     /pbt/guide/ja/     301
/pbt/guide/*      /guide/pbt/:splat  200
/pbt              /goimport/pbt/     200
/pbt/*            /goimport/pbt/     200
